; A window besides the one of Graphics can have a thread of its own that shows the newest of its three pictures whenever there is
; one, or the window asks, at the pace of the display: the program never waits for the window and the window never waits for the
; program (the prototype for the windows and canvases of BlitzPlus). BLITZLLVM_TEST_PRESENTERS makes Graphics open two such
; windows, hand one pictures as fast as it can and the other one every 50 ms, do nothing for a while, wait for a picture to be shown,
; and resize the first, and write what happened to a file. This needs a window and a GPU, so it is skipped without one.
Include "check.bb"

If GetEnv$("BLITZLLVM_HEADLESS") <> "" Then
	Print "graphics_presenters_pixels: skipped, there is no window."
	End
EndIf

SetEnv "BLITZLLVM_TEST_PRESENTERS", "presenters.tmp"
Graphics 320, 240, 32, 2
AutoSuspend False ; Other windows of tests that run at the same time must not stop this one.

f = ReadFile("presenters.tmp")
If f = 0 Then RuntimeError "The result was not written."
frames_a = Int(ReadLine$(f))
If Eof(f) Then RuntimeError "The windows or their threads could not be made."
shown_a = Int(ReadLine$(f))
frames_b = Int(ReadLine$(f))
shown_b = Int(ReadLine$(f))
idle = Int(ReadLine$(f))
waited = Int(ReadLine$(f))
width = Int(ReadLine$(f))
shown_resized = Int(ReadLine$(f))
CloseFile f
DeleteFile "presenters.tmp"

CheckTrue "The fast window got many pictures", frames_a >= 20
CheckTrue "The fast window showed some of them", shown_a >= 1
CheckTrue "The fast window never showed more new pictures than it got", shown_a <= frames_a
CheckTrue "The slow window got about twelve pictures", (frames_b >= 6) And (frames_b <= 14)
Check "The slow window showed each of them", shown_b, frames_b
Check "No new picture is shown while the program does nothing", idle, 0
Check "The pictures waited for were shown", waited, 1
Check "The swapchain follows the window's size", width, 300
Check "The picture is shown again after the resize", shown_resized, 1

; The window of Graphics still works.
Cls
Color 255, 0, 0
Rect 10, 10, 20, 20
Check "Graphics draws", ReadPixel(15, 15) And $FFFFFF, $FF0000
Flip
